{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark, yet cozy, world, you will collect resources, craft, and build to restore Dracula\u2019s former home to its past glory. Attract juicy mortals to the inn, harvest their blood, and serve it to traveling vampires to regain your reputation within vampire society. Will you become a vampire lord?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest Resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/3c91820fc3d8528a75ee3dc376395e6d.poster.avif?t=1767018787\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/3c91820fc3d8528a75ee3dc376395e6d.webm?t=1767018787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/3c91820fc3d8528a75ee3dc376395e6d.mp4?t=1767018787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage, mine, chop, hunt, fish, and grow the resources you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/ac56f14ea84f5a6a60c8a5e09d5bbaff.poster.avif?t=1767018787\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/ac56f14ea84f5a6a60c8a5e09d5bbaff.webm?t=1767018787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/ac56f14ea84f5a6a60c8a5e09d5bbaff.mp4?t=1767018787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft materials to create workstations, furniture, decorations, and restore buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage an Inn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/0353d187c7696e39c1f85edc2fba8b08.poster.avif?t=1767018787\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/0353d187c7696e39c1f85edc2fba8b08.webm?t=1767018787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/0353d187c7696e39c1f85edc2fba8b08.mp4?t=1767018787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain a clean and inviting inn that offers good food and lodgings to weary travellers. Serve food and drink to your human patrons, and then serve their blood in the vampire speakeasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Vampire Lord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock skills and ancient knowledge as you gain experience and influence. Grow stronger, prove your worth, and reclaim your position within Dracula\u2019s Court.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892420?t=1767018787","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/7c826c31d63212efd4e976044c5db4a3790f14b1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767018787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/02fac75f974f56cf044b0fc467c6bb8b82304162/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767018787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/02fac75f974f56cf044b0fc467c6bb8b82304162/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767018787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_