h\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage an Inn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/0353d187c7696e39c1f85edc2fba8b08.poster.avif?t=1767018787\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/0353d187c7696e39c1f85edc2fba8b08.webm?t=1767018787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/extras/0353d187c7696e39c1f85edc2fba8b08.mp4?t=1767018787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain a clean and inviting inn that offers good food and lodgings to weary travellers. Serve food and drink to your human patrons, and then serve their blood in the vampire speakeasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Vampire Lord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock skills and ancient knowledge as you gain experience and influence. Grow stronger, prove your worth, and reclaim your position within Dracula\u2019s Court.</p>","developers":["Growlery Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892420/f198ef9f4c6154365bc91d64339d29e907b50838/header.jpg?t=1767018787","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892420/1044431416/67ace250b7ece5011d3ef9f1553e27f336c60f29/1755267165/dash_av1.mpd?t=17